    "Add restrict qualifiers on all pointer parameters in body_force and helper functions",
    "Hoist p[i] reads (xi,yi,zi) outside inner j-loop to reduce memory traffic",
    "Outer loop unrolling by factor 2 (pairwise computation) to reuse j-coordinate loads for two consecutive i values",
    "Remainder handling for odd number of bodies",
    "Use #pragma omp simd reduction(+:fx_i,fy_i,fz_i,fx_ip1,fy_ip1,fz_ip1) aligned(x,y,z:64) on inner force loop to enable vectorization with alignment hints and multiple accumulators",
